   "_id": 9378,
   "ANSWER": "<ol data-end=\"2645\" data-start=\"1511\">\n\t<li data-end=\"1851\" data-start=\"1479\">\n\t<p><strong data-end=\"1532\" data-start=\"1482\">class WeatherProcessor extends Thread {<br />\n\t&nbsp; &nbsp; private List&lt;String&gt; dataChunk;</strong></p>\n\n\t<p><strong data-end=\"1532\" data-start=\"1482\">&nbsp; &nbsp; public WeatherProcessor(List&lt;String&gt; dataChunk) {<br />\n\t&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; this.dataChunk = dataChunk;<br />\n\t&nbsp; &nbsp; }</strong></p>\n\n\t<p><strong data-end=\"1532\" data-start=\"1482\">&nbsp; &nbsp; public void run() {<br />\n\t&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; for (String data : dataChunk) {<br />\n\t&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; // simulate processing<br />\n\t&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }<br />\n\t&nbsp; &nbsp; }<br />\n\t}</strong></p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"2815\" data-start=\"2647\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2664\" data-start=\"2649\"><strong data-end=\"2663\" data-start=\"2649\">Challenges</strong>:</p>\n\n\t<ul data-end=\"2815\" data-start=\"2667\">\n\t\t<li data-end=\"2721\" data-start=\"2667\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"2721\" data-start=\"2669\"><strong data-end=\"2688\" data-start=\"2669\">Race conditions</strong> when accessing shared resources.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"2762\" data-start=\"2724\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"2762\" data-start=\"2726\"><strong data-end=\"2752\" data-start=\"2726\">Thread synchronization</strong> overhead.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li data-end=\"2815\" data-start=\"2765\">\n\t\t<p data-end=\"2815\" data-start=\"2767\">Difficulty in <strong data-end=\"2794\" data-start=\"2781\">debugging</strong> parallel executions.</p>\n\t\t</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"1851\" data-start=\"1479\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2925\" data-start=\"2817\">Proper use of synchronization and thread-safe structures (e.g., <code data-end=\"2900\" data-start=\"2881\">ConcurrentHashMap</code>) mitigates these issues.</p>\n\n\t<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t</li>\n</ol>\n",
